C --> AIFR006 : "Request Anomaly Transaction Alerts"
C --> AIFR007 : "Request Contextualized News Insights"
C --> AIFR008 : "Request Predictive Intervention Recommendations"
C --> AIFR009 : "Request Client Predictive Insights"

